## What this acceptance establishes

The source suite includes the remote Linux IPC wrapper, which is not skippable
on the Ubuntu runner except through its explicit non-Linux platform guard.
Its passing assertions require four lifecycle cases (normal, deadline,
parent-loss, pinned WorkerRun), four seccomp installations, eight same-UID
matching STREAM/SEQPACKET exposed-socket positive controls, and eight owned
socket removals. Accepted filesystem, Landlock, IP-isolation, privilege-drop
and guardian cleanup checks remain required. WorkerRun retains three
invocations, six ranks, four global and eight rank optimizer updates using
generated tiny CPU tensors, not real model/data.

The former errno-only listener assertion has been replaced by exact
SO_ACCEPTCONN=0 readbacks and rejected nonblocking accept, covering both
explicit listen rejection and a no-op successful return. Original-peer
communication and retarget restrictions are still tested. This correction
passes the native integrated test; no successful listener transition is allowed.
The exact CI kernel release was not captured, so no particular kernel-version
attribution is claimed. The source rationale and tests are in v0.43.

Both failed attempts remain preserved: commit `71eda784` / Source run
`34312382330`, and diagnostic commit `bdc0a4e` / Source run `34314108918`.
Their cleanup was confirmed. They were not deleted or rerun; the accepted run
uses the evidence-backed four-file correction. Filter bytecode, accepted older
fixtures, workflows, private data rules and all earlier evidence were unchanged.

## Roadmap position and next work

This narrow named-UNIX creation/connected-pair acceptance step is complete.
**Gate 5 overall remains partial.** It is not a full IPC or OS sandbox:
SysV IPC, process signaling, host metadata and trusted retained-peer authority
are not proved closed. Runtime origin, real-host binding and integrated
admission are also not yet proved. The next pre-GPU work is to resolve the
remaining host/runtime and isolation obligations against an explicit threat
model, then verify integrated admission without claiming evidence that does
not exist. Real-size relocation and H100 validation remain later steps.

No GPU instance, S3 access, real-model/data read, inference, training, promotion,
dataset seal or registry mutation occurred. Mac work was source/AST/lint plus
992 pure regression tests in 0.646 seconds with no ML imports. Native fixtures
ran only in GitHub CI. No automation or background monitor was created.
